OL,3,GNEWSAMobile network issues could last
OL,4,Aanother six weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA telecoms company says disruption to
OL,7,Fits mobile network will continue for
OL,8,Fanother "four to six weeks" as it works
OL,9,Fto introduce 5G.
OL,11,FIt follows a rise in reports of
OL,12,Fdisrupted service by Sure mobile users
OL,13,Fas the company works to upgrade its
OL,14,Fnetwork to offer higher data speeds and
OL,15,Fbetter coverage.
OL,17,FCEO Alistair Beak said each site or
OL,18,Fmast must be taken off air while being
OL,19,Fupgraded, meaning some customers may
OL,20,Fstill have problems making a call or
OL,21,Fusing data services.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
