OL,3,GNEWSAMobile network issues could last
OL,4,Aanother six weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he expects the full 5G upgrade
OL,7,Fto be completed by the start of
OL,8,FNovember and apologised to customers
OL,9,Ffor any connectivity issues.
